      "description": "A clean, lightweight layout focusing on circular headshots",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tm2-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tm2-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;}\n                          .tm2-head h2{font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:#111;margin:0 0 10px;}\n                          .tm2-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));gap:40px 20px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .tm2-card{text-align:center;}\n                          .tm2-img-wrap{width:160px;height:160px;margin:0 auto 20px;border-radius:50%;padding:5px;border:2px dashed #ccc;transition:border-color 0.3s;}\n                          .tm2-card:hover .tm2-img-wrap{border-color:#10b981;}\n                          .tm2-img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:50%;}\n                          .tm2-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin:0 0 5px;}\n                          .tm2-role{font-size:14px;color:#666;margin:0;}\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tm2-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tm2-head\">\n                            <h2>Our Core Team</h2>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"tm2-grid\">\n                            <div class=\"tm2-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tm2-img-wrap\"><img class=\"tm2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"></div>\n                              <h3 class=\"tm2-name\">Alex Smith</h3>\n                              <p class=\"tm2-role\">Founder & CEO</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm2-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tm2-img-wrap\"><img class=\"tm2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"></div>\n                              <h3 class=\"tm2-name\">Jessica Alba</h3>\n                              <p class=\"tm2-role\">Product Manager</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm2-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tm2-img-wrap\"><img class=\"tm2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531427186611-ecfd6d936c79?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"></div>\n                              <h3 class=\"tm2-name\">Michael Doe</h3>\n                              <p class=\"tm2-role\">CTO</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm2-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tm2-img-wrap\"><img class=\"tm2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"></div>\n                              <h3 class=\"tm2-name\">Emma Watson</h3>\n                              <p class=\"tm2-role\">Art Director</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm2-card\">\n                              <div class=\"tm2-img-wrap\"><img class=\"tm2-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\"></div>\n                              <h3 class=\"tm2-name\">Daniel Craig</h3>\n                              <p class=\"tm2-role\">Senior Developer</p>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "team-3",
      "name": "Creative Staggered Layout",
      "description": "An asymmetrical layout where every second profile is offset vertically, perfect for creative agencies",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tm3-wrap{padding:100px 20px;background:#fafafa;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tm3-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;}\n                          .tm3-left{flex:1;min-width:300px;padding-right:40px;}\n                          .tm3-left h2{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,50px);font-weight:900;color:#111;margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.1;}\n                          .tm3-left p{font-size:16px;color:#666;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 30px;}\n                          .tm3-btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background:#111;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:30px;font-weight:600;transition:background 0.3s;}\n                          .tm3-btn:hover{background:#333;}\n                          .tm3-right{flex:2;min-width:300px;display:flex;gap:20px;margin-top:20px;}\n                          .tm3-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;flex:1;}\n                          .tm3-col.offset{transform:translateY(40px);}\n                          .tm3-card{position:relative;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;}\n                          .tm3-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.8), transparent);opacity:0;transition:opacity 0.3s;}\n                          .tm3-card:hover::after{opacity:1;}\n                          .tm3-img{width:100%;display:block;border-radius:20px;}\n                          .tm3-info{position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;padding:20px;z-index:2;opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:all 0.3s;}\n                          .tm3-card:hover .tm3-info{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}\n                          .tm3-info h4{margin:0;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;}\n                          .tm3-info p{margin:0;color:#ccc;font-size:13px;}\n                          @media(max-width:768px){\n                            .tm3-inner{flex-direction:column;}\n                            .tm3-left{padding-right:0;margin-bottom:40px;text-align:center;}\n                            .tm3-right{width:100%;}\n                            .tm3-col.offset{transform:translateY(20px);}\n                          }\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tm3-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tm3-inner\">\n                            <div class=\"tm3-left\">\n                              <h2>We build digital experiences.</h2>\n                              <p>Our team of designers, developers, and strategists work together to bring your ideas to life with passion and precision.</p>\n                              <a href=\"#\" class=\"tm3-btn\">Join Our Team</a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm3-right\">\n                              <div class=\"tm3-col\">\n                                <div class=\"tm3-card\">\n                                  <img class=\"tm3-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?q=80&w=400&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div class=\"tm3-info\"><h4>Mia Wallace</h4><p>Designer</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tm3-card\">\n                                  <img class=\"tm3-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?q=80&w=400&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div class=\"tm3-info\"><h4>Vincent Vega</h4><p>Developer</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                              <div class=\"tm3-col offset\">\n                                <div class=\"tm3-card\">\n                                  <img class=\"tm3-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?q=80&w=400&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div class=\"tm3-info\"><h4>Jules Winnfield</h4><p>Strategist</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"tm3-card\">\n                                  <img class=\"tm3-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?q=80&w=400&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                                  <div class=\"tm3-info\"><h4>Marsellus</h4><p>Founder</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
    },
    {
      "id": "team-4",
      "name": "Dark Premium Leadership",
      "description": "Wide, horizontal cards with a dark theme, ideal for showcasing executive leadership",
      "html": "\n                        <style>\n                          .tm4-wrap{padding:80px 20px;background:#09090b;font-family:sans-serif;}\n                          .tm4-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:60px;}\n                          .tm4-head h2{font-size:36px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0 0 10px;}\n                          .tm4-head p{color:#a1a1aa;font-size:16px;}\n                          .tm4-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));gap:30px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;}\n                          .tm4-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;background:#18181b;padding:25px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #27272a;transition:border-color 0.3s;}\n                          .tm4-card:hover{border-color:#52525b;}\n                          .tm4-img{width:120px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;border:3px solid #3f3f46;}\n                          .tm4-info{flex:1;}\n                          .tm4-name{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin:0 0 5px;}\n                          .tm4-role{font-size:14px;color:#d4af37;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 10px;}\n                          .tm4-desc{font-size:14px;color:#a1a1aa;margin:0 0 15px;line-height:1.5;}\n                          .tm4-socials a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;margin-right:15px;opacity:0.6;transition:opacity 0.3s;}\n                          .tm4-socials a:hover{opacity:1;}\n                          @media(max-width:600px){\n                            .tm4-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\n                            .tm4-card{flex-direction:column;text-align:center;}\n                            .tm4-socials a{margin:0 7px;}\n                          }\n                        </style>\n                        <section class=\"tm4-wrap\">\n                          <div class=\"tm4-head\">\n                            <h2>Leadership</h2>\n                            <p>Guiding the vision and strategy.</p>\n                          </div>\n                          <div class=\"tm4-grid\">\n                            <div class=\"tm4-card\">\n                              <img class=\"tm4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560250097-0b93528c311a?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                              <div class=\"tm4-info\">\n                                <h3 class=\"tm4-name\">Richard B.</h3>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-role\">Chief Executive Officer</p>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-desc\">Over 20 years of experience leading global tech initiatives and driving growth.</p>\n                                <div class=\"tm4-socials\"><a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"#\">Twitter</a></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm4-card\">\n                              <img class=\"tm4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                              <div class=\"tm4-info\">\n                                <h3 class=\"tm4-name\">Eleanor V.</h3>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-role\">Chief Operating Officer</p>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-desc\">Expert in scaling operations and building high-performance teams worldwide.</p>\n                                <div class=\"tm4-socials\"><a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"#\">Twitter</a></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm4-card\">\n                              <img class=\"tm4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519085360753-af0119f7cbe7?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                              <div class=\"tm4-info\">\n                                <h3 class=\"tm4-name\">James W.</h3>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-role\">Chief Technology Officer</p>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-desc\">Pioneering new architectures and ensuring our technical excellence.</p>\n                                <div class=\"tm4-socials\"><a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"#\">GitHub</a></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tm4-card\">\n                              <img class=\"tm4-img\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?q=80&w=300&auto=format&fit=crop\">\n                              <div class=\"tm4-info\">\n                                <h3 class=\"tm4-name\">Samantha K.</h3>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-role\">Chief Marketing Officer</p>\n                                <p class=\"tm4-desc\">Award-winning marketer focused on brand strategy and customer engagement.</p>\n                                <div class=\"tm4-socials\"><a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"#\">Twitter</a></div>\n                              </div>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </section>\n                    "
